{"seq":2,"slug":"core-contributions","title":"黄仁勋·core-contributions","stage":"DONE","category":"jensen-huang","categoryLabel":"黄仁勋","chapterCount":3,"docCount":6,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/jensen-huang/core-contributions","rating":{"composite":3.72,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.4,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":4,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"hubDir":"/Users/wangyang.learnwy/learnwy/learnwy/l-doc-hub/hubs/famous-people/12_jensen-huang/2_core-contributions","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"核心贡献\">核心贡献</h1><p>本卷呈现黄仁勋与英伟达的核心贡献。从发明并重新定义 GPU，到推出 CUDA 平台、提出加速计算的愿景，再到为人工智能革命提供核心算力、构建人工智能计算帝国，黄仁勋的贡献，深刻地变革了计算的世界。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本卷的定位\">本卷的定位</h2><p>本卷回答的核心问题是&quot;<strong>黄仁勋做出了什么、其技术与产业逻辑为何成立</strong>&quot;，因此重在&quot;贡献本身&quot;的内在机理与权衡。它与同人物其他卷分工明确：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>想了解他<strong>怎么走到这一步</strong>（移民、创业、崛起），看 <a href=\"../life-and-times/\">生平与时代</a>。</li>\n<li>想了解他<strong>靠什么思维方式</strong>做出这些判断（第一性原理、紧迫感文化、领导风格），看 <a href=\"../ideas-and-methods/\">思想与方法</a>。</li>\n<li>想了解这些贡献<strong>对世界的后果与历史评价</strong>，看 <a href=\"../influence-and-legacy/\">影响与遗产</a> 与 <a href=\"../controversies-and-appraisal/\">争议与评价</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"推荐阅读路径\">推荐阅读路径</h2><p>三章按&quot;硬件 → 软件 → 应用&quot;的因果链递进，建议顺序阅读：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>发明 GPU</strong>——硬件根基。先读 <a href=\"inventing-the-gpu/the-graphics-revolution\">图形处理的革命</a>，再读 <a href=\"inventing-the-gpu/redefining-the-gpu\">重新定义 GPU</a>。</li>\n<li><strong>CUDA 与加速计算</strong>——软件杠杆。先读 <a href=\"cuda-and-accelerated-computing/the-cuda-platform\">CUDA 平台</a>，再读 <a href=\"cuda-and-accelerated-computing/accelerated-computing-vision\">加速计算的愿景</a>。</li>\n<li><strong>驱动 AI 革命</strong>——最终成果。先读 <a href=\"powering-the-ai-revolution/the-engine-of-ai\">人工智能的引擎</a>，再读 <a href=\"powering-the-ai-revolution/the-ai-computing-empire\">人工智能计算帝国</a>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>前置知识</strong>：无需专业背景；若对&quot;并行计算&quot;&quot;GPU 与 CPU 的区别&quot;完全陌生，<a href=\"inventing-the-gpu/the-graphics-revolution\">图形处理的革命</a> 中&quot;为什么图形天然是并行问题&quot;一节即是最佳入门。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"inventing-the-gpu","title":"发明GPU","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/jensen-huang/core-contributions/inventing-the-gpu","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-graphics-revolution","title":"图形处理的革命","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/jensen-huang/core-contributions/inventing-the-gpu/the-graphics-revolution"},{"seq":2,"slug":"redefining-the-gpu","title":"重新定义 GPU","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/jensen-huang/core-contributions/inventing-the-gpu/redefining-the-gpu"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"cuda-and-accelerated-computing","title":"CUDA与加速计算","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/jensen-huang/core-contributions/cuda-and-accelerated-computing","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-cuda-platform","title":"CUDA 平台","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/jensen-huang/core-contributions/cuda-and-accelerated-computing/the-cuda-platform"},{"seq":2,"slug":"accelerated-computing-vision","title":"加速计算的愿景","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/jensen-huang/core-contributions/cuda-and-accelerated-computing/accelerated-computing-vision"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"powering-the-ai-revolution","title":"驱动AI革命","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/jensen-huang/core-contributions/powering-the-ai-revolution","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-engine-of-ai","title":"人工智能的引擎","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/jensen-huang/core-contributions/powering-the-ai-revolution/the-engine-of-ai"},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-ai-computing-empire","title":"人工智能计算帝国","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/jensen-huang/core-contributions/powering-the-ai-revolution/the-ai-computing-empire"}]}]}